<section class="hol-body"><header class="hol-banner"><h1>{{name}}</h1><p>Health and recovery</p></header>
{{#if pendingDeath}}<p class="hol-note">An unresolved death roll needs recovery. Record the retained dice and optional note; no new roll will be made.</p><label>Three retained death dice, separated by commas<input name="deathFaces" placeholder="2, 4, 6"></label><label>Note (optional)<input name="deathReason"></label><button type="button" data-action="recoverDeath">Record recovered death result</button>{{/if}}<p>HP {{basis.hp}} / {{basis.maxHp}} · Grit available {{basis.gritAvailable}}</p>
<p class="hol-note">Record a DA-adjudicated recovery event after its action and costs are resolved. This panel does not cast a spell, consume a potion, or grant a free stabilization Maneuver. A safe breath restores HP; wounds and spent Grit remain.</p>
<label>Recovery<select name="kind"><option value="heal">Record healing</option><option value="breath">Safe breath</option>{{#if character}}<option value="stabilize">Record stabilization</option>{{/if}}<option value="correct">DA correction / reconcile survival</option></select></label>
<div data-kind="heal"><p class="hol-note">Automatic worn Life resistance: {{automaticLifeResistance}}. Enter only an additional event resistance below; highest matching resistance applies.</p><div class="hol-pair"><label>Healing before Life resistance<input name="amount" type="number" min="0" step="1" value="1"></label><label>Additional Life resistance<input name="lifeResistance" type="number" min="0" step="1" value="0"></label></div></div>
<div data-kind="correct"><p class="hol-note">Use this for a documented correction or explicit exception. It preserves the existing pending wound records; enter the actual accumulated wound count.</p><label>Correct HP<input name="hp" type="number" min="0" max="{{basis.maxHp}}" step="1" value="{{basis.hp}}"></label>{{#if character}}<label>Survival status<select name="status">{{#each statuses}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{value}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label><div class="hol-pair"><label>Accumulated wounds / scars<input name="wounds" type="number" min="0" step="1" value="{{wounds}}"></label><label>Death marks<input name="marks" type="number" min="0" max="3" step="1" value="{{marks}}"></label></div>{{/if}}</div>
<label>Source note (optional)<input name="reason" type="text"></label><p data-preview aria-live="polite"></p><button type="button" data-action="apply" class="hol-primary">Record recovery once</button></section>
